WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.442 --> 00:00:17.107
Zann kept watching in horror as the smoke sucked the last bit of energy out of the troll.

2
00:00:17.767 --> 00:00:22.850
The creature grunted weakly, and the other trolls stared at it, not understanding what had happened.

3
00:00:23.770 --> 00:00:27.172
One by one, they grunted and fell over as the smoke surrounded them.

4
00:00:29.660 --> 00:00:32.841
"Excellent!" Morb cackled as the last of the trolls crumpled to the ground.

5
00:00:33.542 --> 00:00:35.082
The smoke was still expanding.

6
00:00:35.863 --> 00:00:37.723
Slib backed away, keeping out of range.

7
00:00:37.743 --> 00:00:42.525
"Er, how do you turn it off, Your Majesty?"

8
00:00:42.906 --> 00:00:43.966
he asked nervously.

9
00:00:44.686 --> 00:00:45.347
Morb laughed.

10
00:00:46.887 --> 00:00:47.808
"I don't."

11
00:00:48.588 --> 00:00:52.149
With one hard shove, he sent Slib stumbling into the smoke.

12
00:00:52.990 --> 00:00:57.692
"No!" Slib struggled to escape as the smoke wrapped its tendrils around him.

13
00:00:58.556 --> 00:01:00.738
Moments later he lay on the ground, panting.

14
00:01:00.758 --> 00:01:03.740
"I've lost my magic!"

15
00:01:04.220 --> 00:01:04.660
he cried.

16
00:01:05.721 --> 00:01:08.423
Zann could see Boz and the others still frozen in place.

17
00:01:09.244 --> 00:01:11.245
And the smoke was slowly drifting toward them.

18
00:01:11.926 --> 00:01:14.387
If it reached them, they would all lose their magic!

19
00:01:15.188 --> 00:01:16.869
"Getting nervous, boy?"

20
00:01:17.349 --> 00:01:18.250
Morb cackled again.

21
00:01:19.071 --> 00:01:20.512
Zann quickly pointed at Morb.

22
00:01:20.532 --> 00:01:22.693
"Blast!" he shouted.

23
00:01:23.374 --> 00:01:26.256
Morb lifted a hand and deflected Zann's Blast spell.

24
00:01:26.924 --> 00:01:28.785
"You can't stop me."

25
00:01:29.385 --> 00:01:30.065
Morb laughed.

26
00:01:31.145 --> 00:01:32.606
The smoke was coming toward Zann.

27
00:01:33.406 --> 00:01:36.507
He looked at the jawbone perched atop the magic-sucking machine.

28
00:01:36.527 --> 00:01:38.587
"Hmm," he thought.

29
00:01:38.607 --> 00:01:41.588
"I stopped the other machine by removing that skull."

30
00:01:42.368 --> 00:01:44.449
Zann held out a hand toward the jawbone.

31
00:01:44.469 --> 00:01:47.069
"Come to me," he murmured.

32
00:01:47.810 --> 00:01:49.350
The jawbone shifted slightly.

33
00:01:50.350 --> 00:01:51.111
Morb scowled.

34
00:01:51.131 --> 00:01:53.991
"Haven't you learned that you're no match for me?"

35
00:01:55.052 --> 00:01:56.032
Morb held up a hand.

36
00:01:56.808 --> 00:02:01.392
A shaft of energy shot out, blocking Zann's Transport spell and burning his hand.

37
00:02:01.412 --> 00:02:03.735
"Ouch!" Zann cried.

38
00:02:04.455 --> 00:02:07.958
But, holding out his hand again, he commanded, "Come to me."

39
00:02:07.978 --> 00:02:10.961
"You just won't give up, will you?"

40
00:02:11.321 --> 00:02:14.584
said Morb, sending several bolts of energy toward Zann.

41
00:02:15.305 --> 00:02:17.947
Zann jumped out of the way, and the wall behind him exploded.

42
00:02:20.450 --> 00:02:22.592
Morb strode over to the magic-sucking machine.

43
00:02:23.460 --> 00:02:26.643
"Now I'll show you why there's no point in fighting me."

44
00:02:27.404 --> 00:02:31.608
Morb dipped his hand into the tank and scooped out some of the magic-infused water.

45
00:02:32.309 --> 00:02:37.934
But before he could take a sip, his talisman began to glow, and his hand froze in place.

46
00:02:38.795 --> 00:02:41.777
Glancing over, Zann could see Fala entering the courtyard.

47
00:02:42.478 --> 00:02:44.460
In her hand was the troll talisman.

48
00:02:44.480 --> 00:02:48.604
"How did you Morb cried, unable to move his hand.

49
00:02:49.668 --> 00:02:55.772
Although Morb was immobilized, he apparently still had enough magic to maintain the Flash Freeze he'd placed on

50
00:02:55.833 --> 00:02:56.773
Boz and the others.

51
00:02:57.714 --> 00:03:00.115
And the smoke was now just inches from them.

52
00:03:00.896 --> 00:03:04.538
Fala was frantically trying to free them with the talisman, but it wasn't working.

53
00:03:05.359 --> 00:03:09.202
Zann turned his gaze back to the jawbone and focused all his energy.

54
00:03:09.222 --> 00:03:13.445
"Come to me," he murmured again, holding out his hand.

55
00:03:14.565 --> 00:03:18.208
The jawbone leaped off the machine, and the smoke disappeared instantly.

56
00:03:18.964 --> 00:03:22.186
As soon as Zann caught the bone, its magic energized him.

57
00:03:22.967 --> 00:03:26.330
He could feel sparks flying; his eyes felt strange.

58
00:03:27.230 --> 00:03:30.032
Pointing at Boz and the others, he shouted, "Free!"

59
00:03:30.913 --> 00:03:32.414
Energy shot out everywhere.

60
00:03:33.134 --> 00:03:36.417
Within a moment all the frozen people were able to move again.

61
00:03:37.598 --> 00:03:43.262
But the chaotic magic had also freed Morb, who still had the magic-infused water in his hand.

62
00:03:43.962 --> 00:03:45.764
He raised his hand to his lips.

63
00:03:46.620 --> 00:03:51.041
Using a Blast spell, Zann quickly knocked Morb down, causing him to spill the water.

64
00:03:51.742 --> 00:03:53.842
Then he blasted the tank on the machine.

65
00:03:53.862 --> 00:04:00.084
"No!" Morb howled as the last of the liquid was absorbed into the ground.

66
00:04:01.384 --> 00:04:03.905
Zann lifted the jawbone over his head to smash it.

67
00:04:04.705 --> 00:04:06.506
Morb's eyes filled with panic.

68
00:04:07.386 --> 00:04:08.926
"Wait!" he blurted out.

69
00:04:08.946 --> 00:04:10.967
"I have a proposition for you!"

70
00:04:11.887 --> 00:04:14.248
"I'm not interested," Zann said.

71
00:04:15.092 --> 00:04:19.196
"Oh, you'll be interested in this," Morb said quickly, standing up.

72
00:04:19.216 --> 00:04:23.020
"How would you like to know what happened to your parents?"

73
00:04:24.021 --> 00:04:26.903
"I already know about the accident," said Zann.

74
00:04:27.984 --> 00:04:30.327
Morb was silent for a moment and then spoke.

75
00:04:31.087 --> 00:04:33.149
"Let me tell you something, young man.

76
00:04:33.570 --> 00:04:36.613
Your parents' disappearance was no accident."

77
00:04:37.553 --> 00:04:38.514
Zann was confused.

78
00:04:38.534 --> 00:04:41.473
"Wyssa said—" Morb chuckled.

79
00:04:41.493 --> 00:04:44.915
"Yes, Wyssa thinks it was an accident.

80
00:04:45.775 --> 00:04:51.999
She also thinks it was her fault—that's how I've been able to blackmail her all this time."

81
00:04:52.760 --> 00:04:55.742
Boz called out, "Don't listen to him, Zann!"

82
00:04:56.782 --> 00:04:58.643
But Zann barely heard his grandfather.

83
00:04:59.344 --> 00:05:01.846
Could Morb tell him what really happened to his parents?

84
00:05:02.726 --> 00:05:05.188
Morb's lips curled into an evil grin.

85
00:05:05.992 --> 00:05:12.297
"Just hand me the Mouth of the Undead, Zann, and I'll tell you where your parents are."

86
00:05:13.217 --> 00:05:14.418
"You know where they are?"

87
00:05:14.818 --> 00:05:15.319
said Zann.

88
00:05:15.339 --> 00:05:19.402
"Of course I know where they are," Morb retorted.

89
00:05:19.422 --> 00:05:21.123
"Would you like to see them?"

90
00:05:21.143 --> 00:05:23.685
"What?" Zann thought.

91
00:05:24.025 --> 00:05:29.509
His parents were alive, and he could see them again The arms holding the bone dropped slightly.

92
00:05:30.149 --> 00:05:33.372
Morb saw that his words were working—he was getting to the boy.

93
00:05:34.080 --> 00:05:37.883
"I'll even let your grandfather go with you," he added.

94
00:05:38.944 --> 00:05:40.025
Zann looked at Boz.

95
00:05:40.685 --> 00:05:45.089
The old man had a faint smile that seemed to say, "I know you'll make the right choice."

96
00:05:45.970 --> 00:05:47.151
Zann breathed deeply.

97
00:05:47.911 --> 00:05:49.252
He knew what that choice was.

98
00:05:50.253 --> 00:05:51.294
He looked back at Morb.

99
00:05:51.314 --> 00:05:53.536
"Can I bring Darb too?"

100
00:05:53.936 --> 00:05:54.476
Zann asked.

101
00:05:54.496 --> 00:05:56.578
"Who?" asked Morb.

102
00:05:57.239 --> 00:05:58.159
"What about Perda?"

103
00:05:58.520 --> 00:05:59.060
Zann added.

104
00:05:59.080 --> 00:06:00.641
"And Gliss?

105
00:06:01.102 --> 00:06:02.303
Fala? Teplo?

106
00:06:02.623 --> 00:06:03.744
Can they all come with me?

107
00:06:04.468 --> 00:06:05.909
What about everyone else over there?

108
00:06:06.230 --> 00:06:07.951
What about the rest of Magica?"

109
00:06:08.592 --> 00:06:10.373
"Wh-what are you talking about?"

110
00:06:10.753 --> 00:06:11.474
Morb stammered.

111
00:06:12.575 --> 00:06:14.576
Zann stared deep into Morb's eyes.

112
00:06:15.397 --> 00:06:17.679
"You have nothing to offer me, Morb.

113
00:06:18.500 --> 00:06:24.705
Maybe you can't understand this, but I would never turn my back on my friends—or Magica."

114
00:06:26.086 --> 00:06:30.870
Zann raised the jawbone over his head and threw it down as hard as he could.

115
00:06:31.610 --> 00:06:33.312
Morb's eyes widened with horror.

116
00:06:34.196 --> 00:06:41.102
"No—!" There was a deafening crack, and the two splintered halves of the bone skidded across the cold

117
00:06:41.182 --> 00:06:41.502
floor.
